# DL / Vision Qualitative Review

1. Link every visual artifact to exact provenance.
2. Define the qualitative question before judging.
3. Compare visuals with metrics and known failure modes.
4. Prefer repeated patterns over isolated examples.
5. Call out visual/metric disagreements explicitly.
